{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Demo of <i>Cozy Sanctuary</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch over your <strong>Cozy\u00a0Sanctuary</strong>, where adorable animals find a peaceful home. While you work or relax, your little companions will play, eat, and grow happier under your care!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an <strong>early look</strong> at <i>Cozy Sanctuary</i>, giving you a first taste of the peaceful vibes, cute creatures, and simple mechanics we\u2019re building. There\u2019s plenty more to come, but we\u2019d love for you to try the demo and tell us what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625510/extras/Feed_them.gif?t=1743608051\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What You Can Do in the Demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Care for your animals</strong> \u2014 Keep them fed, clean, and happy with a few simple tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm their food</strong> \u2014 Grow crops, water them, compost for faster growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play &amp; interact</strong> \u2014 Pet your animals, clean up after them, and watch them enjoy toys and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock surprises</strong> \u2014 New creatures, crops, and decorations become available as your sanctuary thrives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate your space</strong> \u2014 Add cozy touches like benches, flowers, and lamps to personalize your haven</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625510/extras/FeedThem.gif?t=1743608051\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's Coming Later:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More animal species to collect and raise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deeper progression and upgrade systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New decorations, toys, and sanctuary expansions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation systems to let your creatures thrive while you chill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625510/extras/Improve-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743608051\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Help Us Make It Better</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is just the beginning! Your feedback will help us grow <i>Cozy Sanctuary</i> into the coziest game it can be.<br>If you enjoy the demo, please consider <strong>wishlisting the game</strong> and joining our community \u2014 it means the world to us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625510/extras/Custom_Them.gif?t=1743608051\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625510?t=1743608051","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625510/147fb3a21f24d4688134349c1d49a10853d975b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743608051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625510/a0a003c2ca86e20058dc811149fd035f07587f6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743608051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625510/a0a003c2ca86e20058dc811149fd035f07587f6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743608051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Demo of <i>Cozy Sanctuary</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch over your <strong>Cozy\u00a0Sanctuary</strong>, where adorable animals find a peaceful home. While you